440px] px-4 tablet:px-8 desktop:px-22"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-6"><h2 class="type-headline-6 tablet:type-headline-3 text-balance">Exchange Traded Products</h2><p class="type-body-2 text-foreground-muted">TXSE supports the listing and trading of Exchange Traded Products (“ETPs”), from ETFs to structured products. Explore the products listed on TXSE and the resources for ETP issuers.</p><a class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-full transition-colors duration-200 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background type-body-4 h-[53px] gap-4 px-[19px] border-[1.5px] no-underline border-[var(--btn-secondary-border)] text-[var(--btn-secondary-text)] hover:border-[var(--btn-secondary-hover-border)] hover:bg-[var(--btn-secondary-hover-bg)] active:border-[var(--btn-secondary-hover-border)] active:bg-[var(--btn-secondary-active-bg)] mt-2 self-start border-[var(--color-light-leather-500)] hover:border-[var(--color-light-leather-500)]" href="/exchange-traded-products"><span class="inline-grid place-items-center leading-[var(--btn-leading,1.5)]"><span class="[grid-area:1/1] group-active:font-medium">View Exchange Traded Products</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="[grid-area:1/1] invisible font-medium">View Exchange Traded Products</span></span><svg viewBox="0 0 14.75 11.0459" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="w-[15px] shrink-0"><path d="M14.5303 6.0533C14.8232 5.76041 14.8232 5.28553 14.5303 4.99264L9.75736 0.21967C9.46447 -0.0732236 8.98959 -0.0732236 8.6967 0.21967C8.40381 0.512563 8.40381 0.987437 8.6967 1.28033L12.9393 5.52297L8.6967 9.76561C8.40381 10.0585 8.40381 10.5334 8.6967 10.8263C8.98959 11.1192 9.46447 11.1192 9.75736 10.8263L14.5303 6.0533ZM0 5.52297V6.27297H14V5.52297V4.77297H0V5.52297Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></a></div></div></section></div></div><div id="resources" class="sc